@ArcaSim.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5030

### REST: estado del servicio
GET {{ArcaSim.Api_HostAddress}}/api/estado
Accept: application/json

### SOAP: FEDummy (igual que en ARCA)
POST {{ArcaSim.Api_HostAddress}}/wsfev1/service.asmx
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://ar.gov.afip.dif.FEV1/FEDummy"

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:ar="http://ar.gov.afip.dif.FEV1/">
  <soapenv:Body>
    <ar:FEDummy/>
  </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

